    related_resource_id : uuid
    occurred_at : timestamptz
  * recorded_at : timestamptz
    recorded_by_user_id : uuid <<FK>>
}

note as BIZ_diagram_14_practice
  BUSINESS PURPOSE
  General physical and care-delivery infrastructure for a private office, clinic,
  medical center, hospital, nursing station, laboratory, imaging site, pharmacy
  counter, mobile unit or virtual service. Hospitals, diagnostic units and
  pharmacies receive explicit domain identities in specialized schemas. A site
  may host them without merging their tenants, credentials or data governance.
  The model implements Organization + Location + HealthcareService +
  PractitionerRole semantics without forcing every professional to own a room.
end note

