note as MIGRATION_diagram_14_practice
  MIGRATION FROM THE PREVIOUS MODEL
  practices remains the stable financial/operational root. consulting_rooms
  becomes care_spaces. practice_practitioners becomes
  practitioner_role_assignments. This preserves practice_id references while
  allowing hospitals, nursing units, departments, beds and mobile services.
  Hosted diagnostic units/pharmacies are linked through organization_affiliations;
  they do not become informal subrecords of the host practice.
end note


